+ *   header, ISPCTL, ISPA(front), ISPB(front), [ISPA(back), ISPB(back)], ISPDBSC,
+ *   PDS bases..., REGION_CLIP, VIEWPORT, WCLAMP, OUTPUT_SEL, VARYING0..2, PPP_CTRL, STREAM_OUT0
